[meta]
lang: en
title: OireMark conformance tests: Images
[/meta]

h1. Images

Tests for Section 8 of the specification.

h2. Basic Images

h3. Image on its own line {#images-basic}
[code om]
![Alt text]:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/image.png" alt="Alt text"></p>
[/code]

h3. Image inside a sentence {#images-in-sentence}
[code om]
Press the ![Gear]:https://example.com/gear.png button.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>Press the <img src="https://example.com/gear.png" alt="Gear"> button.</p>
[/code]

h3. Without a URL it is not an image {#images-no-url}
[code om]
![Alt text] here.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>![Alt text] here.</p>
[/code]

h3. Dimensions without a URL are literal, not an error {#images-no-url-with-size}
[code om]
![Alt text]{300x200} here.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>![Alt text]{300x200} here.</p>
[/code]

h3. Escaped exclamation mark makes a link, not an image {#images-escaped-bang}
[code om]
\![Not an image]:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p>!<a href="https://example.com/image.png">Not an image</a></p>
[/code]

h2. Dimensions

h3. Width and height {#images-size-both}
[code om]
![Alt text]{300x200}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/image.png" alt="Alt text" width="300" height="200"></p>
[/code]

h3. Width only {#images-size-width}
[code om]
![Alt text]{300}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/image.png" alt="Alt text" width="300"></p>
[/code]

h3. Height only {#images-size-height}
[code om]
![Alt text]{x200}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/image.png" alt="Alt text" height="200"></p>
[/code]

h3. Decorative image with dimensions {#images-size-decorative}
[code om]
![]{16x16}:https://example.com/dot.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/dot.png" alt="" width="16" height="16"></p>
[/code]

h3. Uppercase X is an error {#images-size-uppercase-x}
[code om]
![Alt text]{300X200}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Words are an error {#images-size-word}
[code om]
![Alt text]{wide}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Zero is an error {#images-size-zero}
[code om]
![Alt text]{0x200}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Trailing x without height is an error {#images-size-trailing-x}
[code om]
![Alt text]{300x}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Spaces inside the braces are an error {#images-size-spaces}
[code om]
![Alt text]{ 300x200 }:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Empty braces are an error {#images-size-empty}
[code om]
![Alt text]{}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Three dimensions are an error {#images-size-three}
[code om]
![Alt text]{300x200x100}:https://example.com/image.png
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 1
[/code]

h3. Error is reported on the image's line {#images-size-error-line}
[code om]
First paragraph.

Second paragraph with ![Chart]{big}:https://example.com/chart.png inside.
[/code]
[code error]
invalid-image-size 3
[/code]

h2. Alt Text

h3. A number at the end of alt text is not a size {#images-alt-number}
[code om]
![Photo from 2024]:https://example.com/photo.jpg
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/photo.jpg" alt="Photo from 2024"></p>
[/code]

h3. Size-like text in alt is not a size {#images-alt-size-like}
[code om]
![Logo 300x200]:https://example.com/logo.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/logo.png" alt="Logo 300x200"></p>
[/code]

h3. Formatting markers are removed from alt text {#images-alt-markers-removed}
[code om]
![The *new* logo]:https://example.com/logo.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/logo.png" alt="The new logo"></p>
[/code]

h3. Escaped markers stay in alt text {#images-alt-escapes}
[code om]
![A \*star\* rating]:https://example.com/star.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/star.png" alt="A *star* rating"></p>
[/code]

h3. Ampersand in alt text is escaped in the attribute {#images-alt-ampersand}
[code om]
![Salt & pepper]:https://example.com/spices.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/spices.png" alt="Salt &amp; pepper"></p>
[/code]

h3. Empty alt text marks a decorative image {#images-decorative}
[code om]
![]:https://example.com/divider.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://example.com/divider.png" alt=""></p>
[/code]

h2. Linked Images

h3. Linked image {#images-linked}
[code om]
[![Alt text]:https://example.com/image.png]:https://example.com
[/code]
[code html]
<p><a href="https://example.com"><img src="https://example.com/image.png" alt="Alt text"></a></p>
[/code]

h3. Linked image with dimensions {#images-linked-size}
[code om]
[![Home]{32x32}:https://example.com/home.png]:/
[/code]
[code html]
<p><a href="/"><img src="https://example.com/home.png" alt="Home" width="32" height="32"></a></p>
[/code]

h3. Linked decorative image without other text is an error {#images-linked-unnamed}
[code om]
[![]:https://example.com/icon.png]:https://example.com
[/code]
[code error]
unnamed-linked-image 1
[/code]

h3. Linked decorative image with other text is valid {#images-linked-decorative-with-text}
[code om]
[![]:https://example.com/icon.png Settings]:/settings
[/code]
[code html]
<p><a href="/settings"><img src="https://example.com/icon.png" alt=""> Settings</a></p>
[/code]

h2. Image URLs

h3. www gets https {#images-url-www}
[code om]
![Logo]:www.example.com/logo.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="https://www.example.com/logo.png" alt="Logo"></p>
[/code]

h3. Trailing punctuation is not part of an image URL {#images-url-trailing-period}
[code om]
See ![Chart]:https://example.com/chart.png.
[/code]
[code html]
<p>See <img src="https://example.com/chart.png" alt="Chart">.</p>
[/code]

h3. Relative image path is unchanged {#images-url-relative}
[code om]
![Logo]:/img/logo.png
[/code]
[code html]
<p><img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Logo"></p>
[/code]
